  "prefLabel": "Plc 906.07 Acceptable Continuing Education Formats; Documentation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 906.07 Acceptable Continuing Education Formats; Documentation. Allowable formats and the documentation required for each format shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Courses, programs, workshops, and seminars offered as live programming, for which documentation shall be a document issued to the licensee by the course provider or sponsor, such as a certificate of completion, that shows:\n\n(1) The licensee’s name;\n\n(2) The name and location of the course, program, workshop, or seminar;\n\n(3) The name of the provider or sponsoring entity;\n\n(4) The beginning and ending date(s) of the course or program;\n\n(5) The name of each speaker or instructor;\n\n(6) The number of hours credited by the provider or sponsoring entity; and\n\n(7) The printed name and signature or other official insignia of the speaker, instructor, or representative of the provider or sponsoring entity;\n\n(b) Self-study programs using books, audio, video, or computer programs that require passing a written examination, for which documentation shall be the printed or electronic notification from the sponsor or provider that the licensee passed the examination;\n\n(c) Teaching massage therapy, on an hour per hour basis to a maximum of 6 hours per license term, for which documentation shall be the course roster showing:\n\n(1) The date(s) the course was given;\n\n(2) Total number of hours of the course;\n\n(3) The name of each student participant;\n\n(4) The name of the sponsoring organization; and\n\n(5) The instructor’s printed name and signature;\n\n(d) Publication of books or peer-reviewed articles, for 6 hours per book or peer-reviewed article per license term, for which documentation shall be any item showing:\n\n(1) The title of the writing;\n\n(2) Whether the licensee was the sole author or a co-author;\n\n(3) The date of publication; and\n\n(4) For articles, documentation that the writing was peer-reviewed; and\n\n(e) Publication of non-peer reviewed articles, for 3 hours per article per license term, for which documentation shall be any item showing:\n\n(1) The title of the writing;\n\n(2) Whether the licensee was the sole author or a co-author; and\n\n(3) The date of publication.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
}
